<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia's SFE Jan wheat futures up, more active.</title>
<headline>Australia's SFE Jan wheat futures up, more active.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sydney Futures Exchange (SFE) January wheat futures gained A$3.50 on Tuesday to last trade at A$177.00 a tonne on volume of 16 lots.</p>
<p>Activity in January wheat marked a rebound in price after the contract lost A$2.50 on Monday amid lighter volume trading.</p>
<p>Settlement prices for the untraded contracts were mixed.</p>
